  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Deposit",
      "items": [
        "Each deposit invests only its own amount at targetLeverage; idle WETH is invested by reinvest()",
        "Result: collateral = assets × L and debt = assets × (L − 1)",
        "Everything runs inside the PoolManager callback; the outstanding flash loan is kept in transient storage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Withdraw",
      "items": [
        "N is what remains after the strategy's idle WETH",
        "Without debt, the strategy withdraws N from Aave directly, with no flash loan",
        "Collateral ≤ debt reverts with InsufficientEquity; N > equity reverts with WithdrawExceedsEquity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Scope",
      "items": [
        "Shows WETHLoopStrategy; AaveSimpleLendingStrategy only supplies to and withdraws from Aave",
        "mint and redeem follow the same path as deposit and withdraw",
        "Calls to Aave go through the AaveAdapter library, compiled into the strategy"
      ]
    }
  ]
